t the truth.\par \par \uc2 What is the process that`s happening inside that committee right now? It`s kind of unclear to me from the outside as I watch it.\par \par \uc2 PLASKETT: It`s unclear to us as well because Jim Jordan is not being, as I said to him earlier this week in a letter, he`s not being an honest broker, never mind being a colleague and in any way acting as we would in the House with sharing information. And I said to him at the very beginning, there are areas as you said, Chris, that do warrant investigation.\par \par \uc2 We look at COINTELPRO and other things that the \uc2 FBI\uc2  has done. Reports that the news has put out about the \uc2 IRS\uc2  disproportionately auditing working- class people, people of color. There are areas that in fact do need oversight in which the federal government could have been used against the people of the United States. Another instance would be \uc2 Bill Barr\uc2  himself when he was the head of the DOJ, using the Department of Justice, weaponizing it to support false claims by the former president of an election.\par \par \uc2 But they have not been interested in sitting down and talking with us. They have been very secret about who they are meeting with. And when they do put the information out, they`re putting it to the media and putting it out in a way that is not truthful and is not giving the full picture to the American people.\par \par \uc2 And so, it was necessary for us to ensure. we said that we are the truth squad and we`re going to continue to make sure not only that the work of the American people had sent us to Washington is being done, but also in fact that the truth is going -- they`re going to be pulled up each and every time when they are not telling the truth.\par \par \uc2 And think about it, Chris. Think about the resource spent, federal tax resources that have been spent on these goose chases by Jim Jordan after the supposed whistleblowers who are in fact just a grieved disgruntled \uc2 FBI\