ntleman from Colorado Mr. Neguse. And the gentlewoman from California Mrs. Chu.\par \par \uc2 MADDOW (voiceover): He names -- Kevin McCarthy is reading out the escort committee for the President which is a sort of a ceremonial role. We`ll hear from the Vice President now.\par \par \uc2 KAMALA HARRIS\uc2 , VICE PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: The president of the Senate, at the direction of that body, appoints the following Senators as members of the committee on the part of the Senate to escort the President of the United States into the House Chamber. The senator from New York, Mr. Schumer. The senator from Illinois, Mr. Durbin. The senator from Washington, Miss Murray. The senator from Michigan, Miss Stabenow. The senator from Minnesota, Ms. Klobuchar. The senator from Wisconsin. Miss Baldwin. The senator from Kentucky, Mr. McConnell. The senator from South Dakota, Mr. Thune. The senator from Wyoming, Mr. Barasso. The senator from West Virginia, Miss Capito. The senator from Iowa, Miss Ernst. The senator from Montana, Mr. Daines.\par \par \uc2 [20:50:04]\par \par \uc2 MCCARTHY: The members of the Escort Committee will exit the chamber through the lobby doors.\par \par \uc2 MADDOW (voiceover): It`s a reminder that when we are seeing, this you know famous shot of the Speaker of the House and the Vice President over the two shoulders of the president while he`s delivering his remarks, the reason the Vice President is there is not in her capacity as vice president but rather in her capacity as President of the Senate. And so, that`s why you see her explaining the membership of the Escort Committee among Senators for the President just as Speaker McCarthy does for Members of the House.\par \par \uc2 You also saw a number of the Senators at least who came forward after being named part of the Escort Committee who were shaking hands with members of The Joint Chief, including the chairman of the Joint Chiefs there \uc2 Mark Milley\uc2 . Not everybody is there yet in terms