st remain between a woman, her family, her doctor and her faith and not politicians like Governor \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 HAYES: You actually are fairly unique in that you come from Planned Parenthood, you have a background in reproductive choice, and you`re coming from that into elected office. And you don`t -- as far as I can tell, you don`t represent a district that`s like an 80-20 Democratic districts. It`s actually a swing district, and you ran on your background on reproductive choice pre-Dobbs, before Dobbs in 2018, if I`m not mistaken.\par \par \uc2 What have you learned about talking about this issue among voters that might not share all of your politics?\par \par \uc2 ESKAMANI: I learned that abortion access is an issue that is important to people of all political persuasions, whether you`re a Democrat or Republican, NPA, whether you vote or not, abortion remains of a personal, intimate decision and situation that folks of every political ideology want government to stay away from.\par \par \uc2 And the fact that I flipped my seat in 2018, and then kept it in 2020 and 2022 by being abortion out loud, inspire other Democrats to do the same.\par \par \uc2 HAYES: All right, we will see where this all goes. My suspicion is that he`s not going to be able to hold off on the strongest mounting pressure on both sides. And I think you`re right. In terms of his primary positioning, he`s going to see this as crucial for his presidential campaign.\par \par \uc2 I suspect, we will move forward. But I also think that will be a mark that will be very, very hard to undo with the general public. Should it come to that Florida State Representative.\par \par \uc2 Anna Eskamani\uc2 , thank you so much for spending time with us tonight.\par \par \uc2 ESKAMANI: Thank you for having me.\par \par \uc2 HAYES: That does it for ALL IN for this week. "ALEX WAGNER TONIGHT" starts right now. Good evening, Alex.\par \par \uc2 ALEX WAGNER, MSNBC HOST: Chris, there are so many marks that \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  is making that cannot be undone should he choose to run for president?\par \par \uc2 THIS IS A RUSH TRANSCRIPT. THIS COPY MAY NOT BE IN ITS FINAL FORM AND MAY BE UPDATED. END\par \par \uc2 Content and programming copyright 2022 MSNBC.  ALL RIGHTS  RESERVED.  Copyright 2022 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All materials herein are  protected by United States copyright law and may not be reproduced,  distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast without the  prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You may not alter  or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from copies of the  content. \par \par \uc2 Document CHAYES0020221217eicg00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 ALL IN for December 15, 2022, MSNBC\b0\par\par\uc2 Chris Hayes \par \uc2 8,083 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 December 2022\par \uc2 MSNBC: All in with Chris Hayes\par \uc2 CHAYES\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Content and programming copyright 2022 MSNBC. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2022 ASC Services II Media, LLC. All materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast without the prior written permission of ASC Services II Media, LLC. You may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 [20:00:00]\par \par \uc2 JOY REID, MSNBC HOST: Trump had bill this is a major announcement. And today Dark Brandon couldn`t resist tweaking a response, "I had some major announcements the last couple of weeks too. Inflation is easing, I just signed the Respect for Marriage Act, we brought Brittney Griner home, gas prices are lower than a year ago, 10,000 new high-paying jobs in Arizona." However, Biden didn`t come out with his own line of digital trading cards. Looser.\par \par \uc2 That`s tonight`s "REIDOUT". ALL IN with Chris Hayes starts now.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 CHRIS HAYES, MSNBC HOST (voiceover): Tonight, on ALL IN.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: President Trump teased a major announcement.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: This is going to be huge.\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2 , FORMER PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: I`ve just raised the stakes.\par \par \uc2 HAYES: A disgraced ex-president reinvents an old grift as we get evidence he`s at an all-time political low. Then, how even more new Meadows texts prove the Chief`s Chief has been lying post-coup. Marc Elias on why he is still filing lawsuits in the wake of the midterms. And will new police body cam details from the \uc2 Paul Pelosi\uc2  attack quiet the conspiracy theorists?\par \par \uc2 TUCKER CARLSON\uc2 , HOST, FOX NEWS: For some reason, the San Francisco Police Department is refusing to release Friday`s body cam video.\par \par \uc2 HAYES: When ALL IN starts right now.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HAYES (on camera): Good evening from New York. I`m Chris Hayes. Today, the President of the United States \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  posted on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  in all caps, "I had some major announcements the last couple of weeks too." The list of accomplishments includes: inflation easing, signing the Respect for Marriage Act, bringing \uc2 WNBA\uc2  star Brittney Griner home from a Russian prison. Notable accomplishments to be sure. It`s been a good week. But Biden was obviously trolling the ex-president and the only currently declared rival for his current job, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Because yesterday, the one-term, twice-impeached former guy teased on his off-brand social media site, "a major announcement."\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: America needs a superhero.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HAYES: That is obviously ridiculous but \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  does maintain a diminishing but yet still weirdly potent power to attract and hold attention. If he was a superhero, he could be major announcement man, which is why many people fairly assume this major announcement must have something to do with the presidential campaign that he announced majorly last month. So, the right-wing airwaves were buzzing.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: What could that be? President \uc2 Donald J. Trump\uc2  releasing that kind of cryptic like Avengers-style video on his Truth Social page earlier today. I have no clue. We`ve reached out. Mum is the words from Camp Trump.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: This is a big, big deal. President Trump has announced that he will be making an announcement. Folks, he even had lasers coming out of his eyes. He has laser beams, golden laser beams. He`s wearing a superhero costume. This is going to be huge there could be an announcement that he will be running for Speaker of the House. Holy crap.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HAYES: Now, the ex-president could certainly use an injection of energy into his lackluster campaign that he seemed to launch and then promptly forgot about. According to former Trump campaign staffers, there`s no campaign plan. No one wants to join the staff. One former official says, "They don`t want to touch this reincarnation of the campaign with a 10-foot pole." A former advisor called it an unmitigated disaster.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is also at the weakest point of his political career. His polling numbers have hit a new low. Just 31 percent of voters saying they have a favorable opinion of him in the latest Quinnipiac poll. That is his lowest rating since July 2015, just after he announced his first run for president. And remember who \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  was at that time. He was a ludicrous, buffoonish marginal figure, a con man who presided over this preposterous empire of sloppy licensing deals and business failure great and small.\par \par \uc2 I mean who could forget this major announcement?\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : When it comes to great stakes, I`ve just raised the stakes The Sharper Image is one of my favorite stores with fantastic products of all kinds. That`s why I`m thrilled they agree with me. Trump`s Steaks are the world`s greatest steaks and I mean that in every sense of the word. As a gift, Trump Steaks are the best you can give. One bite and you`ll know exactly what I`m talking about. And believe me, I understand steaks. It`s my favorite food, and these are the best.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 [20:05:04]\par \par \uc2 HAYES: I had forgotten they were Sharper Image Steaks which is oh. Now, the notion that that man, that guy, that dude would become President of the United States was ridiculous, but it happened. And these years later, seven years later, seven long, long years later, the tantalizing possibility is looming that our long national nightmare may be coming to a close, that the preposterous bigoted flim-flam man may return to his rightful place, nature healing, to return as the subject of mockery and ridicule. And so, expectations were low for the big announcement today. And when it came, well, watch for yourself.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: Hello, everyone. This is \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 . Hopefully, your favorite president of all time, better than Lincoln, better than Washington, with an important announcement to make. I`m doing my first official \uc2 Donald J. Trump\uc2  NFT collection right here and right now. They`re called Trump Digital Trading Cards. Here`s one of the best parts. Each card comes with an automatic chance to win amazing prizes like dinner with me. I don`t know if that`s an amazing prize, but it`s what we have. Go to collecttrumpcards.com right now. And remember, Christmas is coming and this makes a great Christmas gift.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HAYES: That`s right. The major announcement is a licensing deal. It`s actually perfect. It is the 2022 version of Trump 