on the numerous elected Republican officials who served with \uc2 Nancy Pelosi\uc2 . Musk, who had just recently purchased \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , posted a response to Hillary Clinton pushing this insane homophobic lie about the attack.\par \par \uc2 And that tweet, along with false media reports from lying unnamed sources, gave some kind of imaginary pass to Republican politicians and people in writing media to just run wild with all manner of shameless rumor- mongering, hiding behind the old just asking questions thing.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 JESSE WATTERS, HOST, FOX NEWS: How did this homeless drug addict even get inside the house? Now, there was glass broken at the rear door. We`ve seen those photos, but there looks like there`s glass on both sides.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: It`s weird things going on in that household in the last couple of weeks. The glass, it seems was broken from the inside to the out. And you know, that wasn`t -- so, it wasn`t a break-in, it was a breakout.\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: \uc2 Paul Pelosi\uc2  walked away from the police and toward David DePape. What could possibly explain behavior like that? And what were the two doing for the 30 minutes before police arrived?\par \par \uc2 The police for some reason have refused to release that body cam footage. We get body cam footage every day in the news business but they won`t release this. What is going on here? Why are they hiding this? Is there a good reason? We don`t know.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HAYES: Yes, we don`t know. Why would they not want to release the body cam footage of an 82-year-old man inside his home being brutally assaulted with a hammer? Yesterday, bodycam footage from the responding police officer was played in court. And you`ll never guess what it showed. It was what all of us, including \uc2 Tucker Carlson\uc2 , have always known it was, a brutal and horrific attack on an innocent 82-year-old man.\par \par \uc2 The suspect charged with 